      "description": "Formate symmetric OCO stretch (HCOO*). Position varies with support and adsorption geometry: ~1320 cm⁻¹ on Ru/Al₂O₃, ~1335 cm⁻¹ (quasi-bidentate on Fe₃O₄(111)), ~1350–1380 cm⁻¹ on oxide surfaces (Al₂O₃, CuGaZrOx), ~1369–1377 cm⁻¹ on Fe₃O₄(001). Paired with νas(OCO) above ~1520 cm⁻¹; frequency splitting Δν = νas − νs reflects adsorption geometry (bridging vs. chelating).",
