          "note": "Table 2/Fig. 1a (Ru/Al₂O₃) and Fig. 3a (Ru–6.1%\"Na₂O\"/Al₂O₃ DFM): νs(OCO) HCOO* at 1320 cm⁻¹ on both surfaces, paired with νas at 1520 cm⁻¹; appears at onset of H₂ reduction (320 °C, 20% H₂/N₂). On Ru/Al₂O₃, formate forms via bicarbonate spillover at the Ru–Al₂O₃ interface; on Ru–Na₂O/Al₂O₃, from bidentate carbonate spillover to the Ru–support interface. Identified as a key CO₂ methanation intermediate."
